# Pairs with RetainedRestorable. The pass deletes a doomed sink manifest as
# soon as its row is gone, before the scan has decided whether an increment
# depends on it.
MODULE: RetainedRestorableDeleteBeforeScan
TARGET: RetainedRestorable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a sink manifest is deleted before the dependent scan
PERTURBS: DelMan

--- FIND
    /\ \/ prPh[p] = "delete"
       \/ prPh[p] = "restore" /\ prBlocked[p] = {}
    /\ m \in prDoomed[p] \ prManGone[p]
--- REPLACE
    /\ \/ prPh[p] = "delete"
       \/ prPh[p] = "restore" /\ prBlocked[p] = {}
       \* MUTATION: deletion may start before the scan.
       \/ prPh[p] = "rows" /\ m \in prGone[p]
    /\ m \in prDoomed[p] \ prManGone[p]
--- END